['Supported under every dependence law with these marginals: the marginals fix outage loss.', 'Supported for this class: omit under both laws, although exact expected loss is unidentified.', 'Unsupported for this class: different expected losses always require different optimal actions.', 'Supported for this class: the summary uniquely identifies expected outage loss as 3.'],
